<title>FRANCE: Technip, SGS rise on broker note.</title>
<headline>Technip, SGS rise on broker note.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in engineering group Technip and semiconductor-maker SGS Thomson rose on Friday after their inclusion on Morgan Stanley's list of 40 recommended world stocks, market sources said.</p>
<p>Technip climbed 3.07 percent to 470 francs on turnover of 33,481 shares and SGS added 1.3 percent to 296.80 on volume of nearly 55,000 shares at 1105 GMT.</p>
<p>The U.S. brokerage published on Thursday its study which canvassed 150 analysts on 1,650 companies worldwide.</p>
